ame": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "The Indian influence is still there. It was heavily present even until the 20th century, especially in central and southern Vietnam", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T12:21:56Z", "username": "pratik.s.chandarana", "text": "Yep - I was really surprised to see the remains from that far back still preserved and it is a huge Sanctuary too - took me an entire day to walk thru", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T12:22:08Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Oh sahi hai yaar", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T12:23:17Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Vietnam is basically the easternmost extent of the Indosphere (aside from the Indonesian islands east of it). Coz Philippines has had a mild Indian influence ‎", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T12:28:31Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Easy Q: Connect these (exhaustive):\nSingapore\nTaiwan\nHong Kong\nSouth Korea", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T12:28:47Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "tamil", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T12:28:51Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "No", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T12:29:41Z", "username": "pratik.s.chandarana", "text": "Just a handful of pictures @⁨~Smit D Mahajani⁩ ‎<attached: 00116887-PHOTO-2026-04-15-05-29-41.jpg>", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T12:29:44Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Asian Tigers ?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": true, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"ti